# Used for `docker build -f PayLink/Dockerfile .` (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile).
# Paths are relative to the repository root, which is the build context.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/App_Data/
artifacts/
legacy/
docs/
PayLink/PayLink.Tests/
packages/*.Tests/
.git/
.github/
**/*.md
